OL,3,GNEWSATraffic stopped on A46 due to
OL,4,Alorry fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic has been stopped on the A46 in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire due to a lorry fire.
OL,9,FNational Highways said traffic had been
OL,10,Fstopped in both directions between the
OL,11,FB6166 Farndon and the A6097 Newton.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for Nottinghamshire Fire
OL,14,Fand Rescue Service said it was called
OL,15,Fto the fire on the southbound
OL,16,Fcarriageway shortly after 11:00 BST.
OL,18,FCrews from five stations remain at the
OL,19,Fscene and people have been urged to
OL,20,Favoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
